{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"p-进整数"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"p-进整数"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于素数 $p$, 定义 <strong>$p$-进整数环</strong> $\\mathbb{Z}_p$ 为整数环 $\\mathbb{Z}$ 关于 $p$ 生成的理想 $(p)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"完备化(环)","text":"完备化"}},{"Plain":", 即\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{Z}_p = \\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/(p^n).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}